-- Only the first Worker's runtime serves `RIVETKIT_METRICS_PORT`, so the
-  cluster's metrics cover that Worker's actors only.
+- Each Worker serves metrics on loopback at `RIVETKIT_METRICS_PORT` plus its
+  index. Scrape each port to collect every Worker's metrics. Startup fails if
+  the range exceeds port 65535.
 
